  "definition": "Skills To Be Determined for Physical Therapist Assistants Holding Conditionally Renewed Licenses",
  "effectiveDate": "2024-02-17",
  "historyNote": "#9456, eff 4-17-09; ss by #12088, eff 1-20-17; ss by #13825, eff 2-17-24 (formerly Phy 408.12)",
